No FK, for the same reason as gde_gcc_id.']
  gdwGpvCode String [note: 'Frozen provider code beside the id, readable after the credential is
rotated or retired.']
  gdwGeneratedVia String [note: 'EWB_PORTAL | IRP_WITH_IRN | IRP_BY_IRN — where it was raised. An e-way
