│ me — both pastes of the file hit the 50,000-character message limit     │
│ before it. This model is derived from what the rest of the file states  │
│ about printer_profile plus the house conventions, so the field list is  │
│ a proposal. RECONCILE IT AGAINST §6 BEFORE GENERATING A CLIENT.         │
│                                                                         │
│ Load-bearing and safe (the file says so directly):                     │
│   * prefix prf_, table public.printer_profile                          │
│   * FK to fixed.device_master(dev_id) — "the counter, and its printer"  │
│   * it "asserts compatibility against" §3\'s page geometry, so it must   │
