singular one, so a dual-salesman quote could not be recorded and the
second name was lost the moment it converted. PostgreSQL cannot FK the
ELEMENTS of an array, so the service validates each id against
EmployeeMaster before it writes, and lookups go through the GIN index:
WHERE sq_salesman_id @> ARRAY[:salesman]::uuid[]']
