    (srId, srAccYear) [pk]
    (srCompanyId, srBranchId, srAccYear, srReturnRefno) [unique]
    (srCompanyId, srBranchId, srAccYear, srCounterId, srReturnSlno) [unique]
  }

  Note: 'The credit note.

LIST-partitioned by srAccYear, PK (srId, srAccYear). Partitions come from
public.ensure_acc_year_partitions, which 20260921200000 taught about this
table.

srIsAgainstBill = false is the FREE return: allowed, flagged, priced at the
current selling price, NO COGS reversal (there is no cost to reverse), and
it is the row every audit report lists first.

Settlement has three modes and no fourth:
CASH     refund now; rows in AccTenderDetail
ADJUST   against the party\'s open bills — the ORIGINAL bill first, then
the rest by due date; the remainder becomes a credit note
ADVANCE  the whole amount becomes a credit note the party holds'
}

